<title>USA: TABLE - DocuCon Inc Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - DocuCon Inc Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Six Months Ended</p>
<p>			     June 30,		   June 30,</p>
<p>			  1997	  1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues	$2,688,577  $3,351,968  $5,885,611  $5,685,621</p>
